      "id": "OpeningLand",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "The trail of painted gold leads you east, to the Red Mesas. Here the Orc tribes live on top of the mesas, and they love a good fight.",
        "id-id": "Jejak emas palsu membawamu ke timur, ke Red Mesas. Di sini suku-suku Orc tinggal di puncak mesa, dan mereka sangat suka bertarung."
      },
