    {
      "id": "BossHall",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "At the top of the rails stands Snikkit's Throne Hall, cut into the largest mesa. Its scrap gate rattles open. / Snikkit: Customers! Come in, come in! Mind the bombs.",
        "id-id": "Di ujung rel berdiri Throne Hall milik Snikkit, dipahat di mesa terbesar. Gerbang rongsokannya terbuka sambil berderak. / Snikkit: Pelanggan! Masuk, masuk! Awas bomnya."
      },
