    {
      "id": "BossSnikkit",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Snikkit: So you are the one who followed Snikkit's coins all the way from Hearthvale! They travel far, eh? / You: Your coins paid the Baron's sellswords, Snikkit. And they are painted stone. / Snikkit: Painted with the finest paint! Paint is not cheap, you know.",
        "id-id": "Snikkit: Jadi kamu yang mengikuti koin-koin Snikkit jauh-jauh dari Hearthvale! Koinnya jalan-jalan jauh, ya? / You: Koinmu membayar tentara bayaran sang Baron, Snikkit. Dan koin itu batu yang dicat. / Snikkit: Dicat dengan cat terbaik! Cat itu tidak murah, tahu."
      },
