    {
      "id": "BossChallenge",
      "text": {
        "en-us": "Snikkit: Enough talk! Grukka, show our customer the way out! / Grukka: Hrrr. Gold is gold. Grukka fights. / You: Then fight, Warchief. After this battle, take a good look at your gold.",
        "id-id": "Snikkit: Cukup bicaranya! Grukka, tunjukkan jalan keluar kepada pelanggan kita! / Grukka: Hrrr. Emas ya emas. Grukka bertarung. / You: Kalau begitu bertarunglah, Warchief. Setelah pertempuran ini, lihat baik-baik emasmu."
